{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/c39f4ed61ec38964ab696a18ac823bb7.avif?t=1768823741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras_big/c39f4ed61ec38964ab696a18ac823bb7.avif?t=1768823741 width=1560 height=694 /></span>Scribed castle is a relaxing building game with a unique art style. Dive into relaxing scribing during the day and protecting your town at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a monk who received a manuscript from God that can materialize anything you draw in it into the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scribing surfaces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to scribe, but to draw any structure, you need a surface. So it's time to scribe one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/c12dfa82dc14ae6e50f2f46358a5d800.poster.avif?t=1768823741\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/c12dfa82dc14ae6e50f2f46358a5d800.webm?t=1768823741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/c12dfa82dc14ae6e50f2f46358a5d800.mp4?t=1768823741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scribing structures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a monk, you will scribe structures. You can scribe structure upon structures. Some of them are for decoration, and some for the economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/0a4ee6024921c94b10f9aa5915382741.poster.avif?t=1768823741\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/0a4ee6024921c94b10f9aa5915382741.webm?t=1768823741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/0a4ee6024921c94b10f9aa5915382741.mp4?t=1768823741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Orders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Scribed castle has a special mechanic to help you scribe. It is pre-assembled structures that can give you interesting rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/1253bf115fdfd4a06967997eba359b3e.poster.avif?t=1768823741\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/1253bf115fdfd4a06967997eba359b3e.webm?t=1768823741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/1253bf115fdfd4a06967997eba359b3e.mp4?t=1768823741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn money, you need some folks to work in the fields, and to protect them, you need guards. There are several types of folks, but not everyone is friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/1a5d5f4934e769a5b307bd0e9cae2462.poster.avif?t=1768823741\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/1a5d5f4934e769a5b307bd0e9cae2462.webm?t=1768823741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/1a5d5f4934e769a5b307bd0e9cae2462.mp4?t=1768823741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063810?t=1768823741","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063810?t=1768823741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/ef4bfb087670040360e1a97c2b55626505a01dfc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768823741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/ef4bfb087670040360e1a97c2b55626505a01dfc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768823741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4318910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/c39f4ed61ec38964ab696a18ac823bb7.avif?t=1768823741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras_big/c39f4ed61ec38964ab696a18ac823bb7.avif?t=1768823741 width=1560 height=694 /></span>Scribed castle is a relaxing building game with a unique art style. Dive into relaxing scribing during the day and protecting your town at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a monk who received a manuscript from God that can materialize anything you draw in it into the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_pa